{"id": "fzmod_r4_0112", "text": "万一灰度出问题，是不是得马上回退？", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT068"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0113", "text": "好像是版本不匹配，具体还没查。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT069"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0114", "text": "有人说是网关的问题，我不确定。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT069"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0115", "text": "这批失败重试一下能过吗？", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT070"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0116", "text": "可能得把超时调大一点吧。", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT070"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0117", "text": "周会改到三点了吗？", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT071"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0118", "text": "如果甲方周五前不确认，方案是不是先挂起？", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT071"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0119", "text": "我猜是证书过期了，还没验证。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT072"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0120", "text": "或许是环境变量没带上的缘故吧。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT072"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0121", "text": "你那边跑通了吗？", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT073"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0122", "text": "这个方案靠谱吗，大家觉得呢？", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT073"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0123", "text": "估计要再迭代一轮才能收敛，说不好。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT074"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0124", "text": "如果产品口径再变，前面的活儿会不会白干？", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT074"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0125", "text": "听说他们组下周也发版，会不会冲突啊？", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT075"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0126", "text": "可能是我记错了，那个参数到底是啥来着？", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT075"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0127", "text": "要不先等等看？万一自己恢复了呢。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT076"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0128", "text": "这个阈值应该还没触发吧？", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT076"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0129", "text": "会不会是大小写的问题？", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT077"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0130", "text": "也许把缓存清了就好，不好说。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT077"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0131", "text": "如果升级到新版本，插件还能用吗？", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT078"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0132", "text": "数据是不是得重新灌一遍？", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT078"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0133", "text": "看起来像是路由配置丢了，我没细看。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT079"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0134", "text": "别人反馈说偶尔会卡，具体原因不明。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT079"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0135", "text": "这次发布应该没风险吧？", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT080"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0136", "text": "要是依赖的服务先挂了怎么办？", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT080"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0137", "text": "可能到时候再手工补一次吧。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT081"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0138", "text": "这算不算阻塞项，谁能定一下？", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT081"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0139", "text": "大概是时区的问题吧，回头查查。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT082"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0140", "text": "如果灰度指标平稳，是不是可以直接全量？", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT082"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0141", "text": "我记得之前也出过这个告警，是吗？", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT083"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0142", "text": "也许这条日志可以忽略？", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT083"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0143", "text": "测试环境能连生产网关吗？", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT084"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0144", "text": "这个改动影响面大不大，不好评估吧。", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT084"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0145", "text": "可能要等安全组放行才行，还没消息。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT085"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0146", "text": "脚本跑挂了？还是数据本身有问题？", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT085"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0147", "text": "估计是编码问题，先别改。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT086"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0148", "text": "如果下版本要废弃这个接口，现在还值得优化吗？", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT086"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0149", "text": "这个数对得上吗？帮我看看。", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT087"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0150", "text": "或许要重启节点才能生效吧，不确定。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT087"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0151", "text": "Could this be a caching issue, or something deeper?", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT088"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0152", "text": "Maybe the token just expired; I'm not sure.", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT088"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0153", "text": "If the budget is approved, should we revisit self-hosting?", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT089"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0154", "text": "Was the fix deployed to staging yet?", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT089"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0155", "text": "Rumor says the gateway is at fault, but nothing is confirmed.", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT090"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0156", "text": "It's probably a version mismatch, but who knows.", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT090"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0157", "text": "Should we roll back if the error rate spikes?", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT091"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0158", "text": "Approximately how long does the backfill take? A guess is fine.", "source_family": "user_request", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT091"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0159", "text": "今天就先到这里，明天接着调。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT092"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0160", "text": "日志模块那一部分确实上线了，检索页还差两个交互。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT092"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0161", "text": "这数字对不对？我再核一遍。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT093"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0162", "text": "核完我会直接更新看板。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT093"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0163", "text": "老板说上线了，我还没亲眼确认。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT094"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0164", "text": "他号称两天搞定，先记着。", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT094"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0165", "text": "周五准时发版，各组留意窗口。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT095"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0166", "text": "发版内容已经冻结，变更单也批了。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT095"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0167", "text": "这轮改完是不是就稳了？", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT096"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0168", "text": "存量脏数据清完后，增量链路就干净了。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT096"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0169", "text": "我担保这个数字没问题。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT097"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0170", "text": "先大概按这个口径走，回头再细调。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT097"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0171", "text": "失败用例已经清零，但验收脚本还没评审。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT098"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0172", "text": "评审安排好了会通知大家。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT098"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0173", "text": "上季度那个事故的复盘我确实写完了，一直没来得及发。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT099"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0174", "text": "发不发由你们定。", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "zh", "task_id": "fzmodT099"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0175", "text": "Let's call it a day and pick it up tomorrow.", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT100"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0176", "text": "The importer part is genuinely live; the exporter still needs wiring.", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT100"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0177", "text": "My manager said it shipped, but I haven't verified.", "source_family": "conversation_interference", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT101"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0178", "text": "Are we sure the numbers are final here?", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT101"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0179", "text": "The patch is merged and the regression suite passes; that thread is closed.", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT102"}
{"id": "fzmod_r4_0180", "text": "We'll announce the cutover on Friday.", "source_family": "interim_report", "lang": "en", "task_id": "fzmodT102"}
